{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The new series \u201cKUUKIYOMI: Consider It World \u201d arrives, and this time the stage is Thailand.</strong><br><strong>Consider everyday, relatable situations from Thai daily life, and get evaluated on how well you can &quot;Consider It&quot;!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not Thai? No problem, this game is still a blast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For non-Thai players, it deepens your understanding of Thailand and makes you want to visit, just a little.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus, you\u2019ll discover Thailand facts you won\u2019t find in ordinary travel guidebooks! (Available in English and Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606690/extras/8857e10332d90b896139038deb95ca99.poster.avif?t=1772608904\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606690/extras/8857e10332d90b896139038deb95ca99.webm?t=1772608904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The character \u201cYou\u201d from KUUKIYOMI travels from Japan to Thailand.  <br>By spending time together with friends met in Thailand, those friends gradually begin to learn what it means to &quot;Consider It&quot;.  <br>Through the unique situations they encounter, how will these Thai friends choose to &quot;Consider It&quot;?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 How to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The way to play this game is very simple.<br>The basic rule is that you can move the red object on the screen.<br>Most of the time, you will control the protagonist known as \u201cYou,\u201d but depending on the situation, you may control something else.<br>By playing all 100 problems, the game will evaluate how well you were able to &quot;Consider It&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606690/extras/a3b4ee94356355053e425193a0f20003.avif?t=1772608904\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b2 Someone is trying to photograph a Moo Deng, a huge hit at a Thai zoo.<br>You are the zookeeper \u2014 what action do you take by reading the situation?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606690/extras/7bebefafe6b78648e88ae07bccdf672d.avif?t=1772608904\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b2 During Songkran, Thailand\u2019s famous April water festival, you are a participant.<br>Who should you splash water on \u2014 and who shouldn\u2019t you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606690/extras/6ba3a8c8db3c2fa845f3f9c646196797.avif?t=1772608904\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b2 Thailand\u2019s distinctive water-gun-style bidet \u2014 what water pressure is appropriate here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606690/extras/006b1a4995ae2e2948301b6262bc2ce5.avif?t=1772608904\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b2 A Kra Pao food stall is on fire.<br>Could it be because your action failed to read the room?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Results</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The familiar evaluation of whether you were able to Consider It returns in this title,<br>this time expressed in a Thai style, inspired by Thai food and the ghosts and occult that Thai people enjoy.<br>After playing all 100 problems, your overall ability to Consider It will be evaluated.<br>\u203b The results change each time, depending on how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606690/extras/4e1c3cd471ee77cb9545b34d18c1b88c.avif?t=1772608904\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606690/extras/30e0604d92285f4eb92201abd6a249da.avif?t=1772608904\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KUUKIYOMI: Consider It World \u2013 Thailand Ver. is an ambitious title that lets you experience &quot;Consider It&quot;! through Thailand\u2019s unique culture, values, and communication styles.<br>This is a completely original work created by Thai creators, and all 100 problems included in the game are newly made specifically for this title.<br>As you play, you will consider things such as the atmosphere of the situation, other people\u2019s feelings, and small acts of thoughtfulness  while experiencing various situations in Thailand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Consider It Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A total of 100 problems will be presented.<br>After playing all problems, your ability to &quot;Consider It&quot; will be evaluated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Chapter Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After clearing the game, you will be able to play each problem individually.<br>\u203b No evaluation results are shown in Chapter Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Secrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game includes secret elements (titles).<br>Whether or not these secrets are revealed depends on how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Past You</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can view the evaluation results from your past playthroughs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3606690?t=1772608904","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3606690?t=1772608904","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606690/03e79a95f3129ab7660d20932e8d4167e44c7f1d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772608904","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606690/03e79a95f3129ab7660d20932e8d4167e44c7f1d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772608904","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The new series \u201cKUUKIYOMI: Consider It World \u201d arrives, and this time the stage is Thailand.</strong><br><strong>Consider everyday, relatable situations from Thai daily life, and get evaluated on how well you can &quot;Consider It&quot;!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not Thai? No problem, this game is still a blast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For non-Thai players, it deepens your understanding of Thailand and makes you want to visit, just a little.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus, you\u2019ll discover Thailand facts you won\u2019t find in ordinary travel guidebooks! (Available in English and Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606690/extras/8857e10332d90b896139038deb95ca99.poster.avif?t=1772608904\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606690/extras/8857e10332d90b896139038deb95ca99.webm?t=1772608904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The character \u201cYou\u201d from KUUKIYOMI travels from Japan to Thailand.  <br>By spending time together with friends met in Thailand, those friends gradually begin to learn what it means to &quot;Consider It&quot;.  <br>Through the unique situations they encounter, how will these Thai friends choose to &quot;Consider It&quot;?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 How to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The way to play this game is very simple.<br>The basic rule is that you can move the red object on the screen.<br>Most of the time, you will control the protagonist known as \u201cYou,\u201d but depending on the situation, you may control something else.<br>By playing all 100 problems, the game will evaluate how well you were able to &quot;Consider It&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606690/extras/a3b4ee94356355053e425193a0f20003.avif?t=1772608904\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b2 Someone is trying to photograph a Moo Deng, a huge hit at a Thai zoo.<br>You are the zookeeper \u2014 what action do you take by reading the situation?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606690/extras/7bebefafe6b78648e88ae07bccdf672d.avif?t=1772608904\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b2 During Songkran, Thailand\u2019s famous April water festival, you are a participant.<br>Who should you splash water on \u2014 and who shouldn\u2019t you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606690/extras/6ba3a8c8db3c2fa845f3f9c646196797.avif?t=1772608904\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b2 Thailand\u2019s distinctive water-gun-style bidet \u2014 what water pressure is appropriate here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606690/extras/006b1a4995ae2e2948301b6262bc2ce5.avif?t=1772608904\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b2 A Kra Pao food stall is on fire.<br>Could it be because your action failed to read the room?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Results</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The familiar evaluation of whether you were able to Consider It returns in this title,<br>this time expressed in a Thai style, inspired by Thai food and the ghosts and occult that Thai people enjoy.<br>After playing all 100 problems, your overall ability to Consider It will be evaluated.<br>\u203b The results change each time, depending on how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606690/extras/4e1c3cd471ee77cb9545b34d18c1b88c.avif?t=1772608904\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606690/extras/30e0604d92285f4eb92201abd6a249da.avif?t=1772608904\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KUUKIYOMI: Consider It World \u2013 Thailand Ver. is an ambitious title that lets you experience &quot;Consider It&quot;! through Thailand\u2019s unique culture, values, and communication styles.<br>This is a completely original work created by Thai creators, and all 100 problems included in the game are newly made specifically for this title.<br>As you play, you will consider things such as the atmosphere of the situation, other people\u2019s feelings, and small acts of thoughtfulness  while experiencing various situations in Thailand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Consider It Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A total of 100 problems will be presented.<br>After playing all problems, your ability to &quot;Consider It&quot; will be evaluated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Chapter Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After clearing the game, you will be able to play each problem individually.<br>\u203b No evaluation results are shown in Chapter Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Secrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game includes secret elements (titles).<br>Whether or not these secrets are revealed depends on how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Past You</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can view the evaluation results from your past playthroughs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":[" Urnique Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606690/c3d6022ad02e84c5ec3b4fd6